<PolicyLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How The Curious Brain Toolkit website handles information when you visit its pages or follow an external link.">
  <p>This website provides information about printable resources. It does not provide an account, contact form, checkout or on-site download service.</p>

  <h2>Information when you visit</h2>
  <p>When you visit a page, your browser sends a request to the service hosting this website. The hosting service may process technical information such as your IP address, browser details and the page requested to deliver and protect the site. The information collected, how long it is kept and who can access it depend on the hosting service and its configuration.</p>
  <p>The website does not currently use an analytics service or advertising tracker.</p>

  <h2>Links to Etsy and Instagram</h2>
  <p>Some links take you to Etsy or Instagram. When you follow one, that service operates under its own privacy information and may collect information about your visit. Check its terms and privacy information before sharing personal details or making a purchase.</p>

  <h2>Children and personal information</h2>
  <p>This website is intended to help adults find resources to use with children. It does not ask children to submit personal information. Please do not send sensitive information about a child through a third-party service unless you have considered that service’s privacy terms and have an appropriate basis to do so.</p>

  <h2>Questions or changes</h2>
  <p>For a privacy question, contact the seller through the <a href="https://www.etsy.com/uk/shop/CuriousBrainToolkit">Curious Brain Etsy shop</a>. Hosting and log settings affect the technical information described above.</p>
</PolicyLayout>
